From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hjviewer <haejin.cho@yonsei.ac.kr>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 05:12:40 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] Bump hbb_common to the commit RustDesk client 1.5.0 pins

The client's WebRTC transport needs rendezvous.proto fields (webrtc_sdp_offer,
webrtc_sdp_answer, IceCandidate) that the server's pinned hbb_common predates.
IdPk moved from message.proto into rendezvous.proto. ed25519 1.5.0 accepts
signature 2.x and fails to build, so pin 1.5.3 like the client does.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
